    "section": "Event Companion",
    "summary": "Board B of the Singles Event Companion is a mirror matchup: Take and Hold against Take and Hold, and both players play Battlefield Dominance. The app pairs this board with the Dawn Of War deployment. Neither disposition fixes the Attacker or Defender role; a roll-off settles that. Every zone, territory, objective and terrain position comes only from the official board image, and this entry states no measurements. Its lettered terrain pieces refer to the parts of the Battlefields: Armageddon kit.",
